{"id": "idaho-4", "headline": "Meridian Speedway swaps historic grandstand", "source": "KIVI", "url": "https://www.kivitv.com/news/local-news/in-your-neighborhood/meridian/meridian-speedway-begins-historic-grandstand-overhaul-ahead-of-spring-racing-season", "published": "2026-11-24", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["Meridian Speedway has begun replacing its historic North End grandstand, built in 1964, with a new aluminum structure ahead of the spring racing season. Adam Nelson, owner of the promotions group HWY 16, said the wooden bleachers had not been replaced in more than 60 years. Crews are also clearing part of the barn between the maintenance shop and the beer barn, and the midway will be doubled in width to make room for food and drink stands and more space in the bleachers on busy race nights. The North End is known as the lively party section of the track. Source: KIVI."], "qr": {"n": 45, "rows": ["111111101110000100001000001101111000101111111", "100000101111100101010101110010000101001000001", "101110101110111000100010000000101101001011101", "101110101001110100001100001011110001101011101", "101110100100110000001111101101101111101011101", "100000101010011010011000110100011100001000001", "111111101010101010101010101010101010101111111", "000000000101011000011000111100101001100000000", "110011100100101011101111110101001010000101111", "011000010010110000000010011111100100111111100", "011101110010111000011010001001111101101010010", "011001010100110011010010001100001110010100000", "110101100100101010111011111100101110001100001", "001011000101010100011100001011110101101010110", "100100110000110010101110001010100001001111010", "001011000100010111110111111101001111111000000", "010111111100101011111011001001011111010101011", "011110000000110100010100001111100101101111100", "001000101101010100111000011111100101001010010", "000000000110010000110011000001011010010100000", "100011111101001011101111101101001000111110001", "110010001011100100001000101111100101100010100", "